@startuml

[*] --> ReceiveRequest

state "Identify User" as IdentifyUser
state "Gather Videos" as GatherVideos
state "Add Details" as AddDetails
state "Send Suggestions" as SendSuggestions

ReceiveRequest --> IdentifyUser : user request received
IdentifyUser --> GatherVideos : identify user
GatherVideos --> AddDetails : gather videos
AddDetails --> SendSuggestions : add details
SendSuggestions --> [*] : send suggestions

@enduml
